flowchart TB
  s([deploy.sh ENV PORT SHA]):::gate --> up[docker compose up -d<br/>IMAGE_TAG = SHA]:::job
  up --> sm([smoke_test.sh<br/>200 · healthy · version · nginx]):::cloud
  sm -->|pass| ok[Save SHA as last good<br/>~/.envflow/ENV.last_good]:::prd
  ok --> done([Job green · next environment runs]):::prd
  sm -->|fail| logs[Print app container logs]:::bad
  logs --> rb[Redeploy last good SHA<br/>and verify it]:::stg
  rb --> fail([Job red · promotion stops]):::bad
